le=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.4}\\vdash\nA\\leq_TB\\leftrightarrow\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{OracleTM}(B)\\;\n(A=L(M^B)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;M^B(x)\\downarrow)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.4}\\vdash\nA\\equiv_TB\\leftrightarrow A\\leq_TB\\land B\\leq_TA\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.4}\\vdash\nA\\equiv_TB\\leftrightarrow A\\leq_TB\\land B\\leq_TA\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>这是旧目录的兼容接口。数字标签与 aliases 仅是本目录历史编号，不对应 1979 年原书的定理或定义编号；书源定位以 source_ref 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-oracle-machine-notation","status":"resolved","id":"2a55bf7c4b509350","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-oracle-machine-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-oracle-machine-notation","status":"resolved","id":"2a55bf7c4b509350","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；数值神谕机接口 $\\mathrm{OracleTM}(B),M^B,L(M^B)$ 与 $M^B(x)\\downarrow$ 见 [[73-df-oracle-machine-notation]]，固定其载体 $X=\\mathbb N$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OracleTM}(B),M^B,L(M^B)","display":false},{"tex":"M^B(x)\\downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.4}\\vdash\nA\\leq_TB\\leftrightarro